WEBVTT

00:12:57.397 --> 00:13:01.819
People will tell you that number
reflects consumer demand.

00:13:03.237 --> 00:13:05.572
But that number reflects one thing --

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.200
that number.

00:13:09.326 --> 00:13:12.162
Who can want more of something
they have never been given?

00:13:13.163 --> 00:13:17.084
And how can we believe
we want more of something

00:13:17.084 --> 00:13:22.673
if the reasons for not wanting it
are biological?

00:13:25.008 --> 00:13:26.677
That feels pathological.

00:13:28.428 --> 00:13:30.055
Remember Ada Anderson?